{% comment %}
  Trophy Mart â€” Hero banner slider section (Tailwind-compiled design, mirrors src/components/Hero.tsx).

  This file is self-contained: the compiled Tailwind CSS and all artwork live inside it.
  Upload ONLY sections/hero.liquid - no extra CSS or image files.

  Install: Online Store â†’ Themes â†’ Customize â†’ Add section â†’ "Trophy Mart Hero"
  (usually the first section of the Homepage template, right below the navbar).

  Slides are section blocks: add one "Slide" block per banner and pick a
  desktop image (>640px) and a mobile image (â‰¤640px, portrait 962x1635).
  While no blocks are added, two built-in Trophy Mart banners are shown.
  Behaviour matches the React design: 5.5s auto-advance, 1s crossfade, slow
  7s Ken Burns zoom on desktop, left/right arrows on mobile, vertical dots
  on desktop.
{% endcomment %}

<style>
